{"id": "69096", "title": "忘了去懂你", "author": "权聆", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 5, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/69/69096.htm", "intro": "一对夫妻的婚姻面临七年之痒的考验，他们的生活表面上安稳平静，但因为长期缺乏沟通，成了最熟悉的陌生人。丈夫瞒着妻子借钱给朋友，妻子埋怨丈夫没情调，生活的磕绊中，丈夫怀疑妻子与人偷情……", "base": "files/article/html/69/69096", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10557791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10557792.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10557793.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10557794.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10558783.html", "available": false}]}